cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Evaluation artifact: split-genome GPU kernels for evolutionary algorithms"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Evaluation artifact of the paper "Split-Genome Layouts for Evolutionary Algorithms on
  GPUs: Bottlenecks and Trade-offs at Million-Variable Scale": the CUDA C++ kernels, the
  EvoX-based baselines, every raw timing and fitness trace behind the results, and the
  scripts that regenerate the paper's figures, tables and numbers. Code under the MIT
  license; data in results/ under CC BY 4.0.
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
